{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">汇丰：生益科技，产品结构优化与产能扩张观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数据。生益科技<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">108.8亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">54%</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">34%</span>；净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">21.3亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">147%</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">84%</span>。毛利率达到32.6%，这是这家覆铜板龙头有记录以来最好的季度盈利水平。HSBC在最新报告中把2026年和2027年的每股盈利预测分别上调了52%和72%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告最值得看的判断不是盈利<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>本身，而是<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>的来源。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">HSBC</span>认为，生益科技正在同时吃下两端的红利：高端AI材料持续放量，低端FR-4覆铜板又因为供给紧张而涨价。两条线同时走强，毛利率的弹性才会这么大。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUW5XjLtflNVzcDvUQxDbibtdr2vqrk9CZlypA94Fh2Oib87iaWia86wTjKjHd5vXnibJqKYSlo5Ijpexy6se0KgHawSTdTsbAM76iak/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 高端CCL份额提升与低端涨价同时推高毛利率</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">生益科技<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">32.6%</span>，比去年全年的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26.5%</span>高出6个百分点以上。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">HSBC</span>预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>覆铜板及半固化片业务毛利率分别为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>、31%和32%，而2025年这一数字只有24%左右。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">推动毛利率上行的力量来自两端。高端方面，报告估计生益科技在英伟达M8级材料中拿下了主要份额，高端产品占比和单价都在上升。低端方面，改性FR-4和普通FR-4供应偏紧，因为高端产品挤占了标准产能。建滔今年已经多次发出FR-4相关产品涨价通知，背景是玻纤布和铜箔成本上升、供应紧张。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">HSBC</span>认为生益科技会跟随行业趋势，把上游成本不确定性向下游传导。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看毛利率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">24%</span>到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>这个跳升，它说明涨价不是孤立事件。简单说，高端份额提升决定天花板，低端涨价决定短期弹性，两条线同时走强才撑得起这个毛利率预期；我更关注的是FR-4涨价能持续几个季度，这决定了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>毛利率预测是否还有<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>空间。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWTrlRCyUBjevfkugDG17v6ssesV3AKPohVVscwv5kxq1JcmTG20vFjy1d8WSAjVOkCJsOtKAvfia0VVm8kn9uMicsxXDcAd4sYE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. PCB业务增速<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>，AWS供应链放量是核心变量</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">HSBC</span>把<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>的PCB收入预测分别上调了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26%</span>。生益电子是AWS的关键PCB供应商，随着Trainium3芯片在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>下半年放量，高价值产品出货会明显加快，这有助于对冲上游材料成本不确定性。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">产能也在同步跟上。吉安一期已经进入试产阶段，泰国工厂计划<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>下半年投产，东莞HDI项目在建。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">HSBC</span>认为新增产能既能支撑出货增长，也有助于在海外和国内ASIC/GPU平台拓展客户。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把CCL和PCB两块业务放在一起看，生益科技的逻辑是完整的：上游材料涨价利好覆铜板业务，下游AI服务器需求拉动PCB业务，中间还有产能释放承接订单。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXibib2x7iaZu67dFxvGOVOMQoX3SosrOb4iaaoGEvFLhdn1siaGLRc4bzpOIv0jX4M3JkJCcBCzFLMpCCgXrrzDsp6lZI4bB77oAHs/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 盈利预测大幅<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>，估值锚从周期均值转向成长溢价</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">HSBC</span>将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>每股盈利预测分别上调至3.10元、4.57元和6.17元，对应三年复合增速<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">41%</span>，高于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2016</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2021年</span>周期中段的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19%</span>。目标市盈率从41倍调整到47.8倍，推导逻辑是周期中段平均22倍市盈率乘以成长增速与周期增速的比值。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里有个值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的细节。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXSZHDbJCdckDl11nvgm8s8ibB6hREb4JqlksKQuHicSE9PSBYRx5zx9MbhxahvS2gwsAx0L05V1hfpQaA9SjR7ibar5Vma3GXB50/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 61-HSBC-Shengyi Technology-600183-报告观点- Better mix- more capacity-260819</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
